+---
+"haulers-dream": patch
+---
+
+Support inventory hauling for Misc. Robots and Robots++ by attaching the inventory tracker to their custom pawn family. Respect native robot work roles across automatic, nearby, urgent and en-route storage pickups, while preserving recovery of existing cargo. Robots can use the nearby-haul gizmo without Biotech and the native map menu when Biotech permits direct control.
